    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — OLD R03 AUTOMATION ROUTER\n\nFresh `main@24be27a360d92af83a85d127a6660ebaa47488e0` contains an explicit regression contract in `tests/test_zb_r03_workflow.py`: `test_old_r03_copilot_and_lester_executor_are_out_of_critical_path`, requiring `R03_RETIRED_FROM_AUTOMATION` and absence of `zb-r03-lester-agent.lock.yml` from the active workflow path.\n\nThis PR's purpose is to adopt that old gh-aw production router, so it directly conflicts with the current-main retirement contract and with #251's one product NEXT router.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL`. Preserve branch/history; do not reactivate as production infrastructure.",
